Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.18,0:01:10.69,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.08,0:01:15.28,Opening - Red,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.41,0:01:19.29,Opening - Blue,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.62,0:01:22.09,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.46,0:01:29.43,Opening - Red,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.95,0:01:35.01,Opening - Blue,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Someone once told me, "Your\Ndream will come true someday."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.90,0:01:38.85,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.12,0:01:42.39,Opening - Red,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.74,0:01:45.45,Opening - Blue,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.69,0:01:48.19,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.54,0:01:53.44,Opening - Red,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.72,0:01:56.25,Opening - Blue,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.36,0:01:59.84,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.97,0:02:02.60,Opening - Red,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.77,0:02:05.34,Opening - Blue,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.67,0:02:12.22,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.61,0:02:16.23,Opening - Red,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.14,0:02:20.88,Opening - Blue,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I believe in tomorrow.
