Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.64,0:23:07.97,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}Even though we all want to fly,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.43,0:23:15.21,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}we're being deceived by gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.74,0:23:23.38,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}In reality, everybody can already fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.78,0:23:31.99,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}The reason why that child looks so sad
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.27,0:23:42.96,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}might be because she left her shadow somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.47,0:23:45.65,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}If so...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.13,0:23:50.22,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}If telling you "Thank you",
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.23,0:23:54.19,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}or hearing "Thank you" just makes you smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.11,0:24:01.37,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}then doing those things will make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.75,0:24:05.99,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}And they'll make you happy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.39,0:24:14.82,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}Don't worry, we're together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.66,0:24:20.14,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}It's mysterious as to why tears roll down
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.72,0:24:27.96,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,1500)}even though I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.22,0:00:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It starts here, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.18,0:00:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The journey to make my wish come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.88,0:00:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.72,0:02:37.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.38,0:02:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.99,0:02:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We've finally arrived in the human world where humans reside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.89,0:02:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.27,0:02:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.41,0:02:53.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,From here on, your wish will or will not be granted depending on how well you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.39,0:02:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You understand that too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.30,0:02:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.28,0:03:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:06.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then why the hell are we in this cramped place?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.65,0:03:11.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, it's like we're in a hideout having a secret meeting!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.13,0:03:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.79,0:03:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the only one who's having fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.85,0:03:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato Hanato!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.05,0:03:26.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.06,0:03:27.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's your wish?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.39,0:03:29.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have a place I want to go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:32.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you have to do in order to make your wish come true?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.53,0:03:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to collect a lot of broken hearts into a flask.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Before that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to get a flask!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.73,0:03:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And what do you have to do to get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.53,0:03:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to pass a test to see if I can live here or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.54,0:03:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.41,0:03:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For one whole day, you have to fit into the\Nhuman world and display human common sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.42,0:03:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The test already began.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.61,0:03:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And I'm your proctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.95,0:04:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you get that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.60,0:04:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.55,0:04:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be graded on how well you display human common sense through your actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.22,0:04:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Show me what you've got, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.94,0:04:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Act like a human at a park during Spring!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:18.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.31,0:04:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.83,0:04:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How was that, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.59,0:04:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you, a hibernating bag worm?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.63,0:04:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For crying out loud, you can't even act like a human being at a park.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.71,0:04:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.47,0:04:50.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And also{\fscx250}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.31,0:04:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, why is the trash still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.95,0:04:57.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to miss the bus...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.44,0:05:00.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.48,0:05:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.44,0:05:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shoot! I'm going to be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:08.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.49,0:05:09.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She dropped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.38,0:05:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, here's your next test!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.89,0:05:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What're you going to do about that trash bag? Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.23,0:05:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.20,0:05:27.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The dump... The dump...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.53,0:05:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.15,0:05:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right here...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.34,0:05:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.54,0:05:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.62,0:05:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.47,0:05:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The crows...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.30,0:05:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They have their eyes on the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:05:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up and throw it away or they'll pick you clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.09,0:06:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The crows have their eyes on...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.86,0:06:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.60,0:06:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go, crows!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.15,0:06:30.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.84,0:06:40.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.62,0:06:43.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell were you trying to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The crows were hungry and the sign said "Please be thoughtful".
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.26,0:06:51.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should change your name to Dobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.79,0:06:53.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.19,0:06:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.45,0:06:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.26,0:07:00.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wanna get a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.18,0:07:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's a pretty good place around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.15,0:07:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hitting on her, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be our treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.90,0:07:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.70,0:07:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.01,0:07:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.91,0:07:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't this great, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.63,0:07:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you following them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.50,0:07:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But they're treating me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.80,0:07:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you two okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.99,0:07:32.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're not hurt, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.26,0:07:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You bitch! What did you just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.21,0:07:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you're asking for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.53,0:07:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Annoying kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.27,0:08:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She already has a guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Umm... Thank{\fscx250}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.64,0:08:12.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get carried away when guys give you attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.32,0:08:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.21,0:08:26.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I have a good idea why he thinks that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank god today's a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.54,0:08:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There'll be a lot of people coming to see the flowers, so we're going to be busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.43,0:08:44.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.42,0:08:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.51,0:08:48.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.35,0:08:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.75,0:08:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was a really cute cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.76,0:08:52.53,Default Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:55.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take these plates away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.58,0:08:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.97,0:09:00.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.48,0:09:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, wanna ask him for his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.79,0:09:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.83,0:09:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're so cold, Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.69,0:09:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'd be pretty popular if you smiled a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.91,0:09:15.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're so not cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.37,0:09:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I forgot to turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, Fujimoto speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.54,0:09:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter, Ms. Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.21,0:09:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Those assholes came by again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.78,0:09:39.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hang on, I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.80,0:09:42.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Boss! There's an emergency...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.46,0:09:50.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.89,0:09:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's a lot of people here, Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.44,0:09:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's probably a cherry blossom festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.00,0:10:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I gotta say, something here smells really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.79,0:10:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.45,0:10:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.95,0:10:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're in full bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.49,0:10:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it so beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.01,0:10:22.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, could you pass that here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.99,0:10:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:29.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.56,0:10:31.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.51,0:10:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.67,0:10:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.51,0:10:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No use crying over spilled milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.01,0:10:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.14,0:10:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm already running low on staff...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.00,0:10:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please let me help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.57,0:10:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll pay you back by helping you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.85,0:11:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One beer, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.40,0:11:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.56,0:11:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, my part timer had to run earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.13,0:11:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you're a great help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.08,0:11:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.57,0:11:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad I could be of some help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.11,0:11:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's rare that she does this well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.24,0:11:29.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, my hotpot still isn't ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.67,0:11:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.29,0:11:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.33,0:11:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.89,0:11:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.23,0:11:36.25,Default Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.60,0:11:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, could you help me add stuff to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.55,0:11:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.23,0:11:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.74,0:11:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm adding stuff... to the hotpot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.64,0:11:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This can be a test too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.29,0:11:58.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take a good look at her culinary skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.01,0:12:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're not supposed to add\Nstuff before the water boils!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.87,0:12:10.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't add the meat yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.93,0:12:13.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, why are you adding milk?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.99,0:12:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because it's nutritious{\fscx250}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.49,0:12:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No chocolate!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.25,0:12:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sweet things will cheer you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.29,0:12:23.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No natto!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.10,0:12:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is what hell looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.64,0:12:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,B-But it'd be a waste not to eat it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.65,0:12:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.56,0:12:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:50.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.41,0:12:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wanna try it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.95,0:12:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.16,0:13:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.58,0:13:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tastes great!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.78,0:13:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it does!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.25,0:13:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Young lady, I'll make this our special dish!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.80,0:13:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.35,0:13:12.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're really capable despite your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.10,0:13:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now I wanna try it too...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.62,0:13:19.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But she's just a moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.45,0:13:39.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The common sense you displayed while making the hotpot deserves a 0.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.37,0:13:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.64,0:13:45.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it turned out to be pretty good, so I'll give you a 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:47.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.19,0:13:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't cry, don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.50,0:14:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.25,0:14:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He won't stop crying...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.19,0:14:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.88,0:14:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, it's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.39,0:14:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.73,0:14:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's always like this at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I always bring him here so he won't annoy our neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.16,0:14:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But he won't fall asleep until he's tired of crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.78,0:14:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.49,0:14:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,His mother used to spend a lot of time with him...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When he cries, she sings him a song until he stops crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.24,0:14:58.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's his mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.24,0:15:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's working hard so she can support her child.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.71,0:15:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I need to take good care of him right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.44,0:15:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I tried singing to him, but he won't stop crying...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.97,0:15:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please let me sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.87,0:15:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll sing for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.98,0:15:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I might not be able to sing like his mother, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.77,0:15:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.42,0:15:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.44,0:16:08.16,Insert,,0000,0000,0000,,The flowers that bloom during Spring
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.16,0:16:14.71,Insert,,0000,0000,0000,,and the endless sky of Summer
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.71,0:16:27.16,Insert,,0000,0000,0000,,are both brilliantly engraved into my heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.27,0:16:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, I'm already back at the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.42,0:16:25.65,Insert,,0000,0000,0000,,So don't worry about{\fscx250}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.78,0:16:40.19,Insert,,0000,0000,0000,,Even on rainy days with the windows closed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.97,0:16:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, there's someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.90,0:16:53.90,Insert,,0000,0000,0000,,the overflowing light in my heart soars in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.97,0:17:01.60,Insert,,0000,0000,0000,,Please guide me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.60,0:17:08.10,Insert,,0000,0000,0000,,O' faraway voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.10,0:17:11.92,Insert,,0000,0000,0000,,Like smiles...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.92,0:17:15.06,Insert,,0000,0000,0000,,Like songs...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.06,0:17:21.27,Insert,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the sound of the wind resonating.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.27,0:17:27.75,Insert,,0000,0000,0000,,Whether it's happiness or sadness,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.44,0:17:27.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Singing is the only thing Kobato's good at.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.75,0:17:34.28,Insert,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll shoulder it all and strive forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.19,0:17:31.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, that makes her similar to Kohaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.28,0:17:48.48,Insert,,0000,0000,0000,,These are the things we both hold in our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.77,0:17:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.71,0:18:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.59,0:18:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like he stopped crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.68,0:18:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.92,0:18:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, please sing again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.96,0:18:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! Sing more!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.91,0:18:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's a stage over there! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.92,0:18:33.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.64,0:18:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We got so many gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.44,0:18:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They were thank you gifts for singing.\NAccepting them was the right thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.88,0:18:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.08,0:19:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What about the test?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.49,0:19:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, the test...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.01,0:19:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato Hanato!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.50,0:19:10.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.92,0:19:15.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You acted like an idiot for the first half.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.74,0:19:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And you got lucky with the hotpot you made in the second half.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.13,0:19:22.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But your singing was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.39,0:19:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:25.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.18,0:19:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You just said my singing was okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.47,0:19:32.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You were awful during the first half.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.19,0:19:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's mean! You're horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.32,0:19:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I tried my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.99,0:19:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you were on the margin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.32,0:19:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.65,0:19:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.53,0:19:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.00,0:19:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.41,0:19:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.74,0:19:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening to you too, little songstress.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.10,0:19:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad I bumped into you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.85,0:20:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.72,0:20:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I really wanted to express my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.12,0:20:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the first time he's been so happy from listening to someone other than his mother sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.81,0:20:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But the moment I thought he's cheered up, he fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.69,0:20:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry for leaving without saying thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.31,0:20:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.48,0:20:33.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your singing was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.84,0:20:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I would love to listen to it again next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.38,0:20:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.38,0:20:40.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.82,0:20:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,O-Oh, good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.69,0:21:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato Hanato!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.74,0:21:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.38,0:21:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.23,0:21:41.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.65,0:21:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The flask, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.27,0:21:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's real, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.97,0:21:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you got a hundred from the old lady thanking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.49,0:21:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.85,0:21:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this the real, real thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.12,0:21:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Give it back if you don't want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.00,0:22:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I do! I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.19,0:22:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I heal broken hearts and fill this flask up with heart fragments...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.93,0:22:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your wish will come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.33,0:22:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,However, you {\i1}just{\i0} got your hands on the flask.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.20,0:22:18.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.31,0:22:21.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato Hanato, what's your wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.67,0:22:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have a place I want to go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.10,0:22:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you have to do in order to make your wish come true?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.90,0:22:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to use this flask to\Ncollect a lot of broken hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.99,0:22:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen up, you start here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.96,0:22:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're still far away from your goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.92,0:22:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know! I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.00,0:22:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure, Dobato? You don't look like you mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.21,0:22:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, that's really mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.27,0:22:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My name is Kobato. Kobato Hanato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.64,0:22:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato is good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.92,0:22:54.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't like it, I'll call you Dabada.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.11,0:22:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dabada?!
